docs {
Koreksi kontribusi MAKNA oleh verifikator: isi entity DIGANTI dengan
payload koreksi. Terjemahan lama diganti penuh dengan array
`translations` (minimal 1). Flag `publish` (default true):
- true  → published + verified, contributions.status = "corrected".
- false → is_corrected true, status tetap "pending_review",
          contributions tetap "pending" (lihat request Tanpa Publish).

200 sukses:

  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "contribution_id": "01JDContribution0000000003",
      "entity_type": "meaning",
      "entity_id": "01JDMeaning00000000000000",
      "status": "corrected",
      "is_corrected": true
    }
  }

entity_type tidak cocok → 400 VALIDATION_ERROR.
}

meta {
  name: Correct Contribution (Meaning)
  seq: 8
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/contributions/{{meaning_contribution_id}}/correct
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{access_token}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "entity_type": "meaning",
    "publish": true,
    "comment": "Perbaiki definisi",
    "word_class_id": null,
    "definition": "Bagian kepala untuk melihat",
    "translations": [
      {
        "language_id": "{{indonesian_language_id}}",
        "translation_text": "mata",
        "translation_type": "direct"
      }
    ]
  }
}

tests {
  test("200 + status corrected + entity_type meaning", () => {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(200);
    expect(res.body.data.status).to.equal('corrected');
    expect(res.body.data.is_corrected).to.equal(true);
    expect(res.body.data.entity_type).to.equal('meaning');
  });
}
